            "body": "We can probably agree on the following as a safe ground for this feature:\n> It should be safe to assume that a statically declared function signature will not change at runtime\n> we should ignore decorated functions if there's at least one non-`@cython…` decorator that we don't know.\n\nWe can see later if there's reasonable room for more.",
